@startuml
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #475569
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #94A3B8
autonumber

title 图 6  UML 时序图：结算、确认与快照

actor "账本管理员" as Admin
participant "结算页面" as UI
participant "认证/权限服务" as Auth
participant "结算服务" as Settle
participant "记录仓储" as RecordRepo
participant "结算仓储" as SettleRepo
participant "审计服务" as Audit
actor "所有成员" as Members

Admin -> UI : 发起结算
UI -> Auth : 校验账本管理员权限
Auth --> UI : 校验通过
UI -> Settle : startSettlement(ledgerId)
Settle -> RecordRepo : 读取已审核且未作废记录及承担明细
RecordRepo --> Settle : 记录、承担金额、付款人
Settle -> SettleRepo : 创建待确认结算和成员确认项
Settle -> Audit : 记录发起结算日志
Settle --> UI : 返回待确认结算
UI --> Members : 展示待确认成员

loop 每位成员
  Members -> UI : 提交本人确认
  UI -> Auth : 校验当前成员身份
  Auth --> UI : 校验通过
  UI -> Settle : confirm(settlementId, memberId)
  Settle -> SettleRepo : 保存确认记录
  Settle -> Audit : 记录确认日志
end

alt 全体成员已确认
  Settle -> SettleRepo : 读取结算汇总
  Settle -> SettleRepo : 按 REQ-025 生成并冻结快照
  Settle -> Audit : 记录完成日志
  Settle --> UI : 结算完成
else 仍有成员未确认
  Settle --> UI : 返回未确认成员列表
end

group 并发冲突
  Admin -> Settle : 作废或更正原记录
  Settle --> Admin : 拒绝并提示刷新；已生成快照不得改写
end
@enduml